# VCF compound layer — pipeline output, tracked in git.
# 2026-08-30: reviewed and lifted the blanket exclude — these artifacts are
# load-bearing at runtime, not purely derived/rebuildable (see meta.json,
# which is the pipeline's audit trail and needs version history).
# The two large intermediate tables are excluded pending Git LFS or a
# documented regeneration step: each is a single ~25-30MB file that churns
# heavily on every rebuild.
pipeline/artifacts/vcf/quantities.jsonl
pipeline/artifacts/vcf/form_diffs.jsonl
